WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.570
Welcome to your first day.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.510
I'm Jordan, your point person.

3
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.350
Start here at the team table:

4
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.530
we'll meet your buddy,
walk the studio,

5
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.200
and get your workstation ready.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.760
You won't handle
a client request alone today.

7
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.920
Watch your buddy first,
then try one together.

8
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.120
If you're unsure, stop and ask.

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.000
We'll check in again after lunch.
